    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You channel holy magic into a damaging bolt of divine power. This is a magic missile with a Damage of +9. Targets with the Corruption, Daemonic, Mutation or Undead Creature Trait affected by the spell must pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Toughness Test</strong>, or have their Armour Points and Toughness Bonus ignored.</p><p><strong>Lore:</strong> Grail magics use the lore effects and ingredients of your Troth Wind (Azyr, Ghur, or Ghyran). See @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-nom.nom-journals.JournalEntry.szhETavVooj84NXa.JournalEntryPage.n0mJrnlLoreGrail]{Lore of the Grail}.</p>"
